,707908,191],["καὶ",707031,7],["μάχαι",708601,191]],"Milk out milk, and there shall be butter, and if thou wring [one's ] nostrils there shall come out blood: so if thou extort words, there will come forth quarrels and strifes.",{"s":"m","br":"24:53","q":1.0}]]